HOW TO UPDATE PROTEIN DBS TO ACTUAL ONE

* list of all proteins in pdbe dbs

* list of all proteins which are nissing in the given input directory
./update_protein_database.py --dir ../proteins/

* list of all proteins which are missing in 2dprots web
./update_protein_database.py --twodprots


1/ list of all proteins which are missing in 2dprots web and update local pdb mirror:
./update_protein_database.py --dir ../proteins/ --download_pdb_cif ../pdb_protein_dbs/
# check wheather the structure is ok

2/ update local ligand dbs:
python overprot_multifamily.py --download_family_list_by_size  --config overprot-config-ivarekova.ini --extras  --collect  --only_get_lists  - ../../ligands_input_files --out stdout.txt --err stderr.txt
#takes 12 hours

3/ for each missing protein run:
./generate_protein_diagram.py --protein $i --ligands_json_dir ../ligands_input_files/residue_summaries/
